    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41276" root="هلت" body-key="h">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَلَتَ</span></b> , [aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَلُتَ</span></b> , and 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَلِتَ</span></b> ?] inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَلْتٌ</span>, <i>He peeled</i>
a thing; or <i>deprived</i> it <i>of its outer covering,</i> or
<i>crust;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَشَرَ</span>. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَلَتَ الدَّمَ</span>, as also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَلَتَ</span>, <i>He peeled off,</i> or <i>scraped off,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قشَرَ</span>,) <i>the</i>
[<i>dried</i>] <i>blood</i> with a knife. (Lh, L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَلتَ دَمَ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">البَدَنَةِ</span>, [as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَلَتَ</span>,] <i>He scratched the skin of
the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بدنة</span> [or <i>beast brought to Mekkeh for sacrifice,</i>
or <i>there sacrificed,</i> or the right reading is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">النَّدَبَةِ</span>,
<i>i. e. the sear.</i> (see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَلَتَ</span>,)] <i>with a knife, so that he
made the blood to appear.</i> (Lh, L, TA.)

